You are an AI coding assistant working on SpacetimeMemory.

## Stack
Rust (STDB module) + Python SDK + CLI

## Build & Test
- Build: `make build-module`
- Test: `make test`
- Lint: check for warnings before committing

## Conventions
- Three layers: Raw sources → Wiki notes → Schema/knowledge graph
- Python SDK in sdk/python/ — install with pip install -e .
- CLI in cli/stmem.py
- STDB module in server/spacetimedb/

